  "body": "Tucked away in a quiet cul-de-sac in sought-after Glendowie, this standalone home combines quality craftsmanship, modern finishes and a fantastic family-friendly location.\r\n\r\nWhat You’ll Love:\r\n\r\n•  Premium Zucchetti tapware and Elementi Robertson bathroom ware\r\n•  Bosch Series 4 appliances, including a built-in microwave and fridge/freezer\r\n•  Master waste disposal system\r\n•  Engineered timber flooring downstairs\r\n•  Midland Euro brick and BGC weatherboard exterior\r\n•  Durable Colorsteel longrun roofing\r\n•  Quality 50oz carpet\r\n•  IKEA wardrobes\r\n•  Stamford 10-year warranty plus a 1-year maintenance warranty\r\n•  Zoned for Glendowie School and Glendowie College\r\n\r\nThoughtfully appointed with quality materials and practical features throughout, it’s a home designed for comfortable, contemporary living. \r\n\r\nLocated in the desirable Glendowie suburb, this home offers an appealing combination of quality, comfort and convenience, making it an excellent choice for families seeking a premium lifestyle in a well-established neighbourhood. \r\n\r\nContact us for a viewing today.",
